Git Commands 

To change the folder to Git: git init
To add the file to index area : git add file name or git add . Or git add *
To move it to repo: git commit -m
To check the log: git log
To check the details: git log -p
To check the repo names: git log —oneline
To check the difference made: git diff commitid1 commitid2
To remove a file from index area: git restore —staged filename 

